# Earth Ecosystem AI Directive: One Language, One File Method

Every future update, modification, and feature addition in this repository MUST be made strictly using the "One Language, One File" architecture:

1. Python updates: Modify only `backend.py`.
2. Earth language updates:
   - For .sl code: Modify only `backend.sl` (and `script.sl` if script-specific).
   - For .et code: Modify only `backend.et`.
3. Windows Batch updates: Modify only `backend.bat`.
4. PowerShell updates: Modify only `backend.ps1`.
5. Frontend / Web UI updates: Modify only `backend.html`.
6. C# updates: Modify only `backend.cs`.
7. Java updates: Modify only `backend.java`.
8. Go updates: Modify only `backend.go`.
9. Ruby updates: Modify only `backend.rb`.
10. PHP updates: Modify only `backend.php`.
11. Haskell updates: Modify only `backend.hs`.
12. Prolog updates: Modify only `backend.pl`.
13. JavaScript updates: Modify only `backend.js`.
14. C++ updates: Modify only `backend.cpp`.

NEVER create fragmented one-off script files. Keep all code within each language's single dedicated backend file.
